{"id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate","title":"thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate","path":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique.md","line":197,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique.tex#thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate","uses":["[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#lem:pet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate]]","[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration]]","[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#lem:pet-ch9-kato-inequality]]","[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique.tex","label":"thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate","line":428,"source":"\\begin{theorem}[Gallot's connection-Laplacian estimate]\n  \\label{thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate}\n\n  \\source{petersen:page-0357}\n  \\uses{lem:pet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate, thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration, lem:pet-ch9-kato-inequality}\n  \\dcref{ch9:9.3.2}\n  Let compact $(M,g)$ satisfy the Sobolev hypothesis in\n  \\cref{thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration}, and let $V\\subset\\Gamma(E)$ be finite\n  dimensional.  If every $T\\in V$ obeys\n  $g(\\nabla^*\\nabla T,T)\\le\\lambda|T|^2$, then\n  \\[\n    \\dim V\\le\n    m\\cdot\\exp\\Big(\\frac{2S\\sqrt{\\lambda\\nu}}{\\sqrt{\\nu-1}}\\Big).\n  \\]\n\\end{theorem}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\uses{thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate}\n  \\sketch\n  For \\(f=|T|\\), the tensor Bochner identity and\n  \\cref{lem:pet-ch9-kato-inequality} give \\(\\Delta f\\ge-\\lambda f\\).\n  The argument of \\cref{thm:pet-ch9-gromov-gallot-betti1-estimate}, now using\n  \\cref{thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration}, bounds\n  \\(C(V)\\) by\n  \\(\\exp(S\\sqrt{\\lambda\\nu}/\\sqrt{\\nu-1})\\). Squaring this bound in\n  \\cref{lem:pet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate} gives the conclusion.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Theorem</div></section>[Gallot&#x27;s connection-Laplacian estimate] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-74686d3a7065742d6368392d67616c6c6f742d636f6e6e656374696f6e2d6c61706c616369616e2d657374696d617465\"></span> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source\" style=\"display:block\">Source: <span class=\"reference\">petersen:page-0357</span></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh09_TheBochnerTechnique%23lem%3Apet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate\">↗ lem:pet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh09_TheBochnerTechnique%23thm%3Apet-ch9-moser-iteration\">↗ thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh09_TheBochnerTechnique%23lem%3Apet-ch9-kato-inequality\">↗ lem:pet-ch9-kato-inequality</a> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch9:9.3.2</span></span>Let compact <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(M,g)$\">$(M,g)$</span> satisfy the Sobolev hypothesis in <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh09_TheBochnerTechnique%23thm%3Apet-ch9-moser-iteration\" data-tex-node=\"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-74686d3a7065742d6368392d6d6f7365722d697465726174696f6e\">subsection 2.3</a>, and let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$V\\subset \\Gamma (E)$\">$V\\subset \\Gamma (E)$</span> be finite dimensional. If every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$T\\in V$\">$T\\in V$</span> obeys <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g(\\nabla ^*\\nabla T,T)\\le \\lambda |T|^2$\">$g(\\nabla ^*\\nabla T,T)\\le \\lambda |T|^2$</span>, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  \\dim V\\le m\\cdot \\exp \\Big(\\frac{2S\\sqrt{\\lambda \\nu }}{\\sqrt{\\nu -1}}\\Big).  \\]\">\\[  \\dim V\\le m\\cdot \\exp \\Big(\\frac{2S\\sqrt{\\lambda \\nu }}{\\sqrt{\\nu -1}}\\Big).  \\]</span>  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh09_TheBochnerTechnique%23thm%3Apet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate\">↗ thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate</a> \\sketch For <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f=|T|$\">$f=|T|$</span>, the tensor Bochner identity and <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh09_TheBochnerTechnique%23lem%3Apet-ch9-kato-inequality\" data-tex-node=\"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#lem:pet-ch9-kato-inequality\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a7065742d6368392d6b61746f2d696e657175616c697479\">subsection 2.3</a> give <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\Delta f\\ge -\\lambda f$\">$\\Delta f\\ge -\\lambda f$</span>. The argument of <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh09_TheBochnerTechnique%23thm%3Apet-ch9-gromov-gallot-betti1-estimate\" data-tex-node=\"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-gromov-gallot-betti1-estimate\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-74686d3a7065742d6368392d67726f6d6f762d67616c6c6f742d6265747469312d657374696d617465\">subsection 2.3</a>, now using <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh09_TheBochnerTechnique%23thm%3Apet-ch9-moser-iteration\" data-tex-node=\"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-74686d3a7065742d6368392d6d6f7365722d697465726174696f6e\">subsection 2.3</a>, bounds <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$C(V)$\">$C(V)$</span> by <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\exp (S\\sqrt{\\lambda \\nu }/\\sqrt{\\nu -1})$\">$\\exp (S\\sqrt{\\lambda \\nu }/\\sqrt{\\nu -1})$</span>. Squaring this bound in <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh09_TheBochnerTechnique%23lem%3Apet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate\" data-tex-node=\"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#lem:pet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a7065742d6368392d6c692d64696d656e73696f6e2d657374696d617465\">subsection 2.3</a> gives the conclusion. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#prop:pet-ch9-vanishing-connection-laplacian","next":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#def:pet-ch9-weitzenbock-curvature-operator","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#lem:pet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate","title":"lem:pet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate","label":"lem:pet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration","title":"thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration","label":"thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#lem:pet-ch9-kato-inequality","title":"lem:pet-ch9-kato-inequality","label":"lem:pet-ch9-kato-inequality"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate","title":"thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate","label":"thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate","title":"thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate","label":"thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-lichnerowicz-dimension-estimate","title":"thm:pet-ch9-lichnerowicz-dimension-estimate","label":"thm:pet-ch9-lichnerowicz-dimension-estimate"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate","title":"thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate","tex":"\\begin{theorem}[Gallot's connection-Laplacian estimate]\n  \\label{thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate}\n\n  \\source{petersen:page-0357}\n  \\uses{lem:pet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate, thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration, lem:pet-ch9-kato-inequality}\n  \\dcref{ch9:9.3.2}\n  Let compact $(M,g)$ satisfy the Sobolev hypothesis in\n  \\cref{thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration}, and let $V\\subset\\Gamma(E)$ be finite\n  dimensional.  If every $T\\in V$ obeys\n  $g(\\nabla^*\\nabla T,T)\\le\\lambda|T|^2$, then\n  \\[\n    \\dim V\\le\n    m\\cdot\\exp\\Big(\\frac{2S\\sqrt{\\lambda\\nu}}{\\sqrt{\\nu-1}}\\Big).\n  \\]\n\\end{theorem}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\uses{thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate}\n  \\sketch\n  For \\(f=|T|\\), the tensor Bochner identity and\n  \\cref{lem:pet-ch9-kato-inequality} give \\(\\Delta f\\ge-\\lambda f\\).\n  The argument of \\cref{thm:pet-ch9-gromov-gallot-betti1-estimate}, now using\n  \\cref{thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration}, bounds\n  \\(C(V)\\) by\n  \\(\\exp(S\\sqrt{\\lambda\\nu}/\\sqrt{\\nu-1})\\). Squaring this bound in\n  \\cref{lem:pet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate} gives the conclusion.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#lem:pet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate","title":"lem:pet-ch9-li-dimension-estimate","description":""},{"node":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration","title":"thm:pet-ch9-moser-iteration","description":""},{"node":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#lem:pet-ch9-kato-inequality","title":"lem:pet-ch9-kato-inequality","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}